ed":2132751168,"version":2,"versionNonce":1084782882,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Reliability","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Reliability","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"2r1iZqoLZVi7wdlCis_hj","type":"text","x":2440.0,"y":8451.0,"width":950.0,"height":70.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["mwD_gM7gMGIb_lKNqZXrz"],"frameId":null,"index":"bK4","roundness":null,"seed":307303973,"version":2,"versionNonce":1687178750,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Timeouts and retries; degrade gracefully when agents fault; surface errors, don't hide them; validate agent output before passing it\non; circuit breakers for agent dependencies; isolate agents (one shared model endpoint or knowledge store can rate-limit parallel\nagents); use SDK checkpoints to recover from interruptions and deployments; persist task progress, intermediate results and history\nin a durable store","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Timeouts and retries; degrade gracefully when agents fault; surface errors, don't hide them; validate agent output before passing it\non; circuit breakers for agent dependencies; isolate agents (one shared model endpoint or knowledge store can rate-limit parallel\nagents); use SDK checkpoints to recover from interruptions and deployments; persist task progress, intermediate results and history\nin a durable store","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"2AwgNY_T03tOzJvjnTODK","type":"text","x":2310.0,"y":8535.0,"width":110.0,"height":17.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1864ab","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["mwD_gM7gMGIb_lKNqZXrz"],"frameId":null,"index":"bK5","roundness":null,"seed":460335813,"version":2,"versionNonce":258435789,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Security","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Security","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"2pFiNMYuNZXfWMBXP-cCJ","type":"text","x":2440.0,"y":8535.0,"width":950.0,"height":52.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["mwD_gM7gMGIb_lKNqZXrz"],"frameId":null,"index":"bK6","roundness":null,"seed":90846184,"version":2,"versionNonce":2097521749,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Authenticate and secure the network between agents; review inter-agent messages for data privacy; audit trails; least privilege;\nsecurity trimming in EVERY agent; content-safety guardrails at user input, tool calls, tool responses and final output; Foundry: an\nidentity per agent, Conditional Access, sponsors and expiry, no API keys on endpoints","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Authenticate and secure the network between agents; review inter-agent messages for data privacy; audit trails; least privilege;\nsecurity trimming in EVERY agent; content-safety guardrails at user input, tool calls, tool responses and final output; Foundry: an\nidentity per agent, Conditional Access, sponsors and expiry, no API keys on endpoints","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"kcJW1U-r590VprLH3E90C","type":"text","x":2310.0,"y":8601.5,"width":110.0,"height":17.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1864ab","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds